WEBVTT

01:26.377 --> 01:29.967
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

01:35.477 --> 01:38.807
<b>Suwa Grand Shrine is much obliged
to the Governor of Shinano</b>

01:38.897 --> 01:41.317
<b>for his generous offering
at the Misayama Festival the other day.</b>

01:41.397 --> 01:42.937
<b>This is a gift from us,
as a token of appreciation.</b>

01:43.027 --> 01:45.357
<b>If you would be so kind
as to deliver it to Sadamune for us.</b>

01:45.437 --> 01:48.567
<b>Yes, sir. My lord will be delighted.</b>

01:50.617 --> 01:52.077
<b>MESSENGER OGASAWARA CLAN
SHINZABURO AKAZAWA</b>

01:52.157 --> 01:55.287
<b>I must say,
these are quite expensive gifts!</b>

01:56.827 --> 01:59.037
<b>And we accept them most graciously.</b>

01:59.117 --> 02:02.337
<b>My lord did emphasize that
we must pull out all the stops</b>

02:02.417 --> 02:05.007
<b>for this grand occasion that is
the Misayama Festival.</b>

02:07.127 --> 02:09.127
<b><i>They were all at each other's throats</i>
<i>before over territory,</i></b>

02:09.217 --> 02:11.137
<b><i>and yet</i>
<i>they still maintain proper etiquette.</i></b>

02:11.217 --> 02:15.597
<b><i>Just what I'd expect from the great Suwa</i>
<i>Grand Shrine and the Governor of Shinano.</i></b>

02:15.677 --> 02:18.137
<b>I must express my deepest thanks
to Sadamune and his entire family</b>

02:18.227 --> 02:20.647
<b>for his endless kindness
and consideration.</b>

02:20.727 --> 02:22.897
<b>Oh, no. It's really nothing.</b>

02:22.977 --> 02:27.067
<b>I do, however,
have one small request from my lord.</b>

02:27.987 --> 02:29.317
<b>Your wish is my command.</b>

02:29.397 --> 02:34.697
<b>If we could please have Chojumaru join us
as an envoy to deliver these gifts.</b>

02:34.787 --> 02:36.077
<b>Wait! That's…</b>

02:36.157 --> 02:38.287
<b>We will provide an adequate escort,</b>

02:38.367 --> 02:41.037
<b>so we would very much appreciate it
if you could send him on his own.</b>

02:41.117 --> 02:44.667
<b>I'm sure the Suwa family can stand
to part with one insignificant child</b>

02:44.747 --> 02:45.957
<b>for a period, no?</b>

02:46.547 --> 02:47.757
<b><i>Do they know who I am?</i></b>

02:47.837 --> 02:51.717
<b><i>No. Your cover-up to hide</i>
<i>your true identity should be flawless.</i></b>

02:52.217 --> 02:54.217
<b><i>But Sadamune is sharp.</i></b>

02:54.297 --> 02:58.677
<b><i>He may have found some proof, or he may</i>
<i>intend on uncovering it upon meeting you.</i></b>

02:59.597 --> 03:03.437
<b><i>To refuse would raise even more suspicion.</i>
<i>What will you do?</i></b>

03:04.607 --> 03:05.857
<b>Yes! Me! Can I suggest something?</b>

03:05.937 --> 03:09.067
<b>Surely it would be all right for just me
to accompany him, right?</b>

03:09.147 --> 03:12.067
<b>I'd feel bad sending the poor little thing
off on his own.</b>

03:12.157 --> 03:13.777
<b>No. We want--</b>

03:13.867 --> 03:18.197
<b>Or would a young girl on her own
in your entourage spell trouble</b>

03:18.287 --> 03:19.407
<b>for the Ogasawara clan?</b>

03:22.207 --> 03:25.377
<b>Then shall we arrange for departure
to be tomorrow morning?</b>

03:26.337 --> 03:27.417
<b>Fine.</b>

03:29.877 --> 03:32.927
<b>With Ayako around,
well, I guess it should all work out.</b>

03:33.007 --> 03:34.597
<b>Really?</b>

03:34.677 --> 03:37.507
<b>I know I can count on her
with a sword, but…</b>

03:38.017 --> 03:41.847
<b>There's no need to worry. She may
not look it, but she is quick-witted.</b>

03:43.227 --> 03:44.857
<b>Don't you worry.</b>

03:44.937 --> 03:47.067
<b>If I can't protect the Young Lord
from something as trivial as this,</b>

03:47.147 --> 03:48.857
<b>I'll never be like Tomoe Gozen.</b>

03:48.937 --> 03:50.357
<b>Tomoe Gozen?</b>

03:50.857 --> 03:54.487
<b>A military commander once lived in Shinano
by the name of Kiso Yoshinaka.</b>

03:55.117 --> 03:58.697
<b><i>He lost his entire family at a young age</i>
<i>and fled to Shinano,</i></b>

03:58.787 --> 04:02.577
<b><i>where he grew up and gained the strength</i>
<i>to overturn the lord.</i></b>

04:03.077 --> 04:06.837
<b><i>He's the exact same as me.</i>
<i>He has the same goal.</i></b>

04:06.917 --> 04:08.127
<b><i>And at Lord Yoshinaka's side,</i></b>

04:08.207 --> 04:10.297
<b><i>growing up beside him</i>
<i>and eventually becoming his vassal,</i></b>

04:10.377 --> 04:13.587
<b><i>was the brave Tomoe Gozen,</i>
<i>always there to protect him.</i></b>

04:14.637 --> 04:15.967
<b><i>As someone originally from Shinano,</i></b>

04:16.047 --> 04:18.177
<b><i>and as someone who has always aspired</i>
<i>to a life of martial arts,</i></b>

04:18.257 --> 04:21.387
<b><i>Tomoe Gozen is her ultimate role model.</i></b>

04:21.477 --> 04:22.727
<b>I see.</b>

04:23.477 --> 04:27.767
<b>So, why is she practicing
carrying two leather dummies?</b>

04:27.857 --> 04:31.027
<b><i>Tomoe Gozen had superhuman strength.</i></b>

04:31.107 --> 04:37.117
<b><i>She once grabbed two warriors, one on each</i>
<i>side, and snapped their necks right off.</i></b>

04:37.197 --> 04:41.947
<b>I want to snap some necks too!</b>

04:46.537 --> 04:49.037
<b>The only issue now is
how to answer Sadamune's questions.</b>

04:49.747 --> 04:50.797
<b>TOKIYUKI
MEMORIAL</b>

04:50.877 --> 04:52.797
<b><i>I will now explain it like a game.</i></b>

04:52.877 --> 04:55.007
<b><i>Okay. Thank you.</i></b>

04:55.087 --> 04:55.967
<b>JULY 1</b>

04:56.047 --> 04:58.137
<b><i>Sorry! Did I keep you waiting for long?</i></b>

04:58.217 --> 04:59.047
<b>NO, I JUST GOT HERE</b>

04:59.137 --> 05:00.847
<b><i>When Sadamune asks you a question…</i></b>

05:00.927 --> 05:02.057
<b>I AM A HOJO</b>

05:02.137 --> 05:03.137
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

05:03.847 --> 05:05.557
<b><i>Detection!</i></b>

05:05.637 --> 05:06.517
<b>YOU DIED</b>

05:06.597 --> 05:10.227
<b><i>I see a future where if you answer</i>
<i>incorrectly, your life will be in danger.</i></b>

05:10.317 --> 05:12.777
<b><i>Oh, no! So what do I do?</i></b>

05:12.857 --> 05:15.777
<b><i>It was the same for Lord Yoshinaka.</i></b>

05:16.607 --> 05:19.907
<b><i>He excelled at warfare, but lacked proper</i>
<i>manners and consideration for others.</i></b>

05:19.987 --> 05:22.537
<b><i>After a string</i>
<i>of poor judgment and missteps,</i></b>

05:22.617 --> 05:25.327
<b><i>he lost the people's support,</i>
<i>and it led to his doom.</i></b>

05:26.417 --> 05:29.497
<b>And so, as we don't want you
to meet the same fate…</b>

05:30.707 --> 05:32.457
<b>Study rigorously!</b>

05:32.547 --> 05:34.587
<b>You must fill that head of yours
with knowledge</b>

05:34.667 --> 05:37.047
<b>so that Sadamune
doesn't become suspicious tomorrow.</b>

05:37.717 --> 05:40.137
<b><i>Am I really going to be okay?</i></b>

05:43.717 --> 05:45.637
<b>SHINANO
THE NEW GOVERNOR'S RESIDENCE</b>

05:51.147 --> 05:54.227
<b>My Lord, I bring you Chojumaru.</b>

05:54.317 --> 05:56.567
<b>Good. Let him in.</b>

06:01.237 --> 06:04.537
<b>Then, we will wait outside the room.</b>

06:13.337 --> 06:16.087
<b><i>He is intimidating up close.</i></b>

06:17.087 --> 06:21.347
<b><i>But I won't lose. He is nothing</i>
<i>but cheap tricks and dirty plots.</i></b>

06:22.007 --> 06:23.637
<b><i>I am the son of a Hojo.</i></b>

06:23.717 --> 06:26.177
<b><i>I also come</i>
<i>bearing the name of Suwa Grand Shrine.</i></b>

06:27.887 --> 06:29.477
<b><i>I won't let anyone underestimate me.</i></b>

06:29.557 --> 06:30.897
<b>Correct that posture.</b>

06:32.647 --> 06:36.317
<b>This is how you sit
when you want to show respect to someone.</b>

06:36.397 --> 06:40.987
<b>You just made a grand gesture of sitting
down because you're facing an enemy.</b>

06:41.067 --> 06:42.617
<b>On the contrary.</b>

06:42.697 --> 06:44.907
<b>The enemy is a taker of lives,</b>

06:44.987 --> 06:49.207
<b>which is precisely why you must show
respect for the lives they would take.</b>

06:50.117 --> 06:52.747
<b><i>During this time period,</i>
<i>both men and women would usually sit</i></b>

06:52.827 --> 06:54.997
<b><i>either cross-legged</i>
<i>or with one knee drawn up.</i></b>

06:55.667 --> 07:00.047
<b><i>The practice of sitting in seiza style</i>
<i>became widespread during the Edo Period,</i></b>

07:00.127 --> 07:02.467
<b><i>and is rooted in the etiquette guidelines</i>
<i>as compiled by Sadamune Ogasawara.</i></b>

07:03.047 --> 07:08.097
<b><i>I was the one to underestimate him.</i>
<i>What begins now is a battle of words.</i></b>

07:10.187 --> 07:11.307
<b><i>If I don't flee with my words,</i></b>

07:12.937 --> 07:14.397
<b><i>I will be pierced with words.</i></b>

07:23.777 --> 07:26.237
<b>Begging your pardon, but how old are you?</b>

07:27.737 --> 07:31.957
<b>-I'm nine.
-Really? You don't look nine.</b>

07:32.037 --> 07:35.087
<b>I was about to ask you
to become my mistress.</b>

07:35.587 --> 07:39.207
<b>One could mistakenly think
your body was fully grown.</b>

07:42.337 --> 07:44.177
<b>I get that a lot.</b>

07:44.847 --> 07:47.057
<b>We have received
your token of appreciation.</b>

07:47.137 --> 07:49.887
<b>Please send Yorishige my regards.</b>

07:49.977 --> 07:51.137
<b>Yes. I will.</b>

07:51.807 --> 07:55.477
<b><i>Is this kid a Hojo? Or just some brat?</i></b>

07:55.977 --> 07:59.277
<b><i>I'll keep firing him with questions</i>
<i>and see how he responds.</i></b>

08:01.607 --> 08:05.737
<b>Say, kid.
You're actually sitting quite nicely.</b>

08:05.817 --> 08:09.407
<b>Quite unnatural for a Suwa warrior
with an uncivilized upbringing.</b>

08:09.997 --> 08:11.657
<b>One could also say
shooting a shrine maiden in the ear</b>

08:11.747 --> 08:13.367
<b>is suggestive
of an uncivilized upbringing.</b>

08:14.627 --> 08:17.787
<b><i>He dodged the question</i>
<i>by immediately firing back with retorts.</i></b>

08:18.497 --> 08:20.627
<b>All is fair in a battle.</b>

08:20.707 --> 08:22.257
<b>If there's one thing I know for sure,</b>

08:22.337 --> 08:24.427
<b>it's that proper manners won't win the day
in a real fight.</b>

08:24.507 --> 08:27.677
<b>And you have been nothing
but a constant thorn in my side</b>

08:27.757 --> 08:29.137
<b>ever since the dog-shooting competition.</b>

08:29.967 --> 08:31.557
<b>You must be
the child of someone important.</b>

08:31.637 --> 08:33.887
<b>The child of a famous warrior
or something.</b>

08:34.727 --> 08:39.567
<b>State your lineage!
As you would on the battlefield.</b>

08:41.107 --> 08:42.777
<b>My forebear is Koizumi Gengoro.</b>

08:42.857 --> 08:44.447
<b>He was a resident of Okaya-no-sho,</b>

08:44.527 --> 08:47.237
<b>and was elevated to the chief guard
of Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

08:48.157 --> 08:50.367
<b>Koizumi Gorosaburo became
the fifth chief guard under his lineage,</b>

08:50.447 --> 08:53.407
<b>and he also ensured that his soldiers
received a proper education.</b>

08:54.117 --> 08:56.327
<b>And I am Chojumaru, one of his sons.</b>

08:58.667 --> 09:01.707
<b><i>He speaks without hesitation,</i>
<i>and his posture is entirely composed.</i></b>

09:02.207 --> 09:06.177
<b><i>If he's lying, could it be because</i>
<i>Yorishige has carefully trained him?</i></b>

09:06.257 --> 09:07.927
<b>I confirmed the existence
of your forebears</b>

09:08.007 --> 09:10.677
<b>and that they died last year in a fire.</b>

09:10.757 --> 09:12.347
<b>I can see they also had a son.</b>

09:12.977 --> 09:15.097
<b>But something's off here.</b>

09:15.187 --> 09:20.897
<b>Some locals have stated
both parent and child died in the fire.</b>

09:23.437 --> 09:26.147
<b>I left my parents in the burning building
and fled on my own.</b>

09:27.067 --> 09:29.907
<b>-It is something I feel great shame over…
<i>-Forgive me, Mr. Koizumi.</i></b>

09:30.907 --> 09:33.247
<b><i>I never knew you, and now I am using your</i>
<i>untimely death as my own personal shield.</i></b>

09:33.327 --> 09:35.157
<b>The fire consumed all, even the bodies,</b>

09:35.247 --> 09:37.457
<b>so it's no wonder some people thought
I died along with them.</b>

09:38.247 --> 09:40.957
<b>There is something even more perplexing.</b>

09:41.037 --> 09:43.837
<b>These retainers of yours.</b>

09:43.917 --> 09:47.217
<b>Kojiro, to be precise…
He is of the Nezu clan.</b>

09:47.297 --> 09:48.677
<b>And this Ayako of yours,</b>

09:48.757 --> 09:52.307
<b>I hear she is the illegitimate child
of the Mochizuki clan.</b>

09:54.017 --> 09:58.597
<b>Both illustrious houses that have
prospered in Shinano for generations!</b>

09:59.147 --> 10:01.397
<b>What reason could they possibly have
for entering into the service</b>

10:01.477 --> 10:02.647
<b>of the child of a chief guard?</b>

10:02.727 --> 10:04.397
<b>I am aware of their lineage.</b>

10:04.987 --> 10:08.737
<b>Upon our first meeting at Suwa
Grand Shrine, we played a game of tag.</b>

10:08.817 --> 10:11.527
<b>They now call me "lord" because I won.</b>

10:12.827 --> 10:15.117
<b>We are just children playing
lord and vassal.</b>

10:16.327 --> 10:20.377
<b>We are simply rehearsing for the day
we pledge our loyalty to a true lord.</b>

10:21.537 --> 10:23.497
<b>Do the inner workings of child's play</b>

10:23.997 --> 10:26.717
<b>really intrigue the eminent
governor of Shinano this much?</b>

10:28.127 --> 10:32.217
<b><i>Impressive. Each and every response</i>
<i>even more articulate than the last.</i></b>

10:32.297 --> 10:35.467
<b><i>That fear and bravado he had upon entering</i>
<i>the room has completely dissipated.</i></b>

10:35.557 --> 10:38.137
<b><i>It's almost as if he's enjoying</i>
<i>this back-and-forth now.</i></b>

10:38.847 --> 10:42.107
<b><i>He is a peculiar young brat</i>
<i>who loves playing hard to get.</i></b>

10:42.687 --> 10:46.237
<b><i>I wonder if he particularly excels</i>
<i>at dodging the truth as well?</i></b>

10:48.947 --> 10:50.987
<b>Shinzaburo. Enter!</b>

10:52.777 --> 10:56.117
<b>So, kid. Was yesterday
your first time meeting this fellow?</b>

10:57.617 --> 10:59.997
<b>I think I may have seen him
at the dog-shooting competition…</b>

11:00.077 --> 11:03.787
<b>Prior to that, I was on duty in Kamakura.</b>

11:04.627 --> 11:06.087
<b>I know Kamakura well.</b>

11:06.167 --> 11:09.717
<b>I often visited the area where the Hojos
and their important retainers reside.</b>

11:10.337 --> 11:13.047
<b>Now that I see you up close, I am certain.</b>

11:13.547 --> 11:17.097
<b>Yes. I've seen this child
many times before.</b>

11:17.177 --> 11:19.427
<b><i>How will you plead?</i></b>

11:19.517 --> 11:23.357
<b><i>If you try to talk your way out of</i>
<i>this one, your composure should slip.</i></b>

11:23.977 --> 11:26.277
<b><i>"Where?" "You couldn't have seen me."</i></b>

11:26.777 --> 11:30.947
<b><i>I'll be watching for the slightest slip</i>
<i>in composure during your reply.</i></b>

11:32.867 --> 11:34.987
<b>Why would you make up a lie like that?</b>

11:35.827 --> 11:37.037
<b>Huh?</b>

11:37.117 --> 11:39.287
<b>What reason could the child
of a Suwa Grand Shrine chief guard</b>

11:39.367 --> 11:42.537
<b>possibly have for being among
the great eminence of those in Kamakura?</b>

11:43.827 --> 11:48.257
<b><i>He's bluffing. We generally travel by</i>
<i>palanquin on official outings anyway.</i></b>

11:48.337 --> 11:50.667
<b><i>Even if it were a time</i>
<i>when I was running away from practice,</i></b>

11:50.757 --> 11:54.337
<b><i>such provincial warriors</i>
<i>would not even know who I am.</i></b>

11:55.047 --> 11:59.267
<b><i>And besides, I had invented plenty</i>
<i>of secret routes so as to not be spotted.</i></b>

12:01.267 --> 12:04.437
<b><i>Never underestimate the Elusive Son.</i></b>

12:04.517 --> 12:08.317
<b>You're calling me a liar?
I was in Kamakura for five years!</b>

12:08.397 --> 12:10.107
<b>I know everything
there is to know about Kamakura…</b>

12:10.187 --> 12:12.357
<b>You are free to lie,
if that's what you want to do…</b>

12:13.197 --> 12:15.067
<b><i>But a poor bluff</i>
<i>is the same as a poor follow-up attack.</i></b>

12:15.157 --> 12:16.367
<b><i>You make it so easy</i></b>

12:16.447 --> 12:18.577
<b><i>for your opponent to counter,</i>
<i>even when on the run.</i></b>

12:22.157 --> 12:25.957
<b>…did the Ogasawara clan send
a liar as their messenger to us?</b>

12:28.587 --> 12:32.417
<b>Shinzaburo. Enough.
You may take your leave.</b>

12:35.837 --> 12:37.257
<b>-Damn it!
-Good job!</b>

12:37.887 --> 12:40.267
<b><i>Not a single slip-up from this one.</i></b>

12:40.347 --> 12:43.187
<b><i>Is he a master at hiding his true colors,</i></b>

12:43.267 --> 12:46.017
<b><i>or does he really</i>
<i>have nothing to do with the Hojos?</i></b>

12:46.607 --> 12:49.357
<b>Oh, my! I am so late.</b>

12:50.227 --> 12:52.067
<b>You're late, Ichikawa.</b>

12:52.567 --> 12:55.987
<b>My apologies. I was left stranded
by a landslide.</b>

13:00.787 --> 13:04.537
<b>I need to use the privy.
I can't hold it any longer.</b>

13:08.787 --> 13:11.207
<b><i>Truly, the mind of a nine-year-old.</i></b>

13:11.297 --> 13:14.837
<b><i>Leaving her station</i>
<i>at the worst possible moment for her lord.</i></b>

13:15.337 --> 13:18.757
<b>All right, kid. Now the real fun begins.</b>

13:18.847 --> 13:21.347
<b>Do not mistake
my behavior for mere rudeness.</b>

13:21.427 --> 13:24.267
<b>I am operating under the suspicion
that you are a surviving Hojo.</b>

13:24.347 --> 13:28.267
<b>Naturally, I must use everything within
my disposal to weed out such survivors.</b>

13:28.357 --> 13:31.397
<b>As a last resort, I would like to monitor
your face up close</b>

13:31.477 --> 13:33.857
<b>and listen for the truth
from your heartbeat.</b>

13:33.937 --> 13:35.897
<b>Hey! What happened to proper manners?</b>

13:35.987 --> 13:36.987
<b>I told you!</b>

13:37.067 --> 13:39.947
<b>Manners and battle are
two separate things. And this is a battle.</b>

13:40.027 --> 13:42.077
<b>You can't just change things up like that!</b>

13:42.157 --> 13:43.327
<b>I will tell you one thing.</b>

13:43.407 --> 13:46.577
<b>No one has managed to maintain
a lie under these conditions.</b>

13:46.667 --> 13:51.547
<b>Are you ready?
I will now ask the pivotal question…</b>

13:52.747 --> 13:56.087
<b>Are you a Hojo?</b>

14:06.187 --> 14:11.647
<b>DO RE MI FA SOL LA TI</b>

14:11.727 --> 14:14.567
<b>Hey!
I'm trying to listen to his heart here!</b>

14:26.787 --> 14:28.997
<b>All right, people of Ogasawara!</b>

14:29.077 --> 14:31.167
<b>Who's ready for a dance battle
with the great Ayako?</b>

14:32.337 --> 14:34.757
<b>What marvelous dancing, my lady!</b>

14:36.087 --> 14:38.677
<b>Just how many instruments are you playing?
That's amazing!</b>

14:38.757 --> 14:44.427
<b>DO RE MI FA SOL LA TI</b>

14:44.517 --> 14:48.187
<b><i>Dengaku. It was like this period's version</i>
<i>of "club music."</i></b>

14:49.097 --> 14:51.437
<b><i>It stirs something so deep within</i>
<i>that it shakes people to their core</i></b>

14:51.517 --> 14:54.777
<b><i>from all walks of life,</i>
<i>regardless of social standing.</i></b>

14:55.317 --> 14:58.607
<b>Hey! Why is everyone out here
dancing with that girl?</b>

14:59.147 --> 15:03.237
<b>Well, she just started
playing music all of a sudden.</b>

15:03.777 --> 15:06.497
<b>She said, "Sadamune's having a great time
talking with the kid,</b>

15:06.577 --> 15:09.117
<b>so we should all get together
and have a good time too."</b>

15:11.327 --> 15:12.327
<b>PROVINCE OF SHINANO
PROVINCIAL CAPITAL</b>

15:12.417 --> 15:13.417
<b>NAKANO TOWN, TAKAI DISTRICT</b>

15:13.497 --> 15:15.167
<b><i>We will destroy the cliff</i>
<i>to keep Ichikawa stranded.</i></b>

15:15.247 --> 15:20.797
<b><i>But if he does come, Ayako,</i>
<i>you must leave immediately.</i></b>

15:21.387 --> 15:24.297
<b><i>With their superhuman eyes</i>
<i>and ears combined,</i></b>

15:24.387 --> 15:28.347
<b><i>Sadamune and Ichikawa could uncover</i>
<i>even Lord Tokiyuki's true identity.</i></b>

15:28.427 --> 15:30.937
<b><i>You must block</i>
<i>either their sight or their hearing.</i></b>

15:31.437 --> 15:35.437
<b>Hey! Cut that out! We're in the middle
of a very important conversation!</b>

15:35.517 --> 15:41.317
<b>Wow, really? I didn't think you could have
important conversations with children.</b>

15:41.817 --> 15:44.447
<b>And we planned on leaving soon.</b>

15:44.527 --> 15:45.697
<b>Some warriors from Suwa should be</b>

15:45.777 --> 15:48.117
<b>on their way
to the border to escort us right now.</b>

15:49.657 --> 15:54.127
<b>Can you imagine what might happen
if the children come home late?</b>

15:54.207 --> 15:56.547
<b>Well, you're being too loud!
Just wait a little longer.</b>

15:56.627 --> 15:57.627
<b>Young Lord?</b>

15:59.167 --> 16:01.677
<b>Don't worry. I am right here with you.</b>

16:09.517 --> 16:11.387
<b><i>She captivated both my eyes and ears.</i></b>

16:13.557 --> 16:15.307
<b><i>And not just with her music</i>
<i>and her dancing.</i></b>

16:15.897 --> 16:19.187
<b><i>But with her gorgeous, long limbs,</i>
<i>and an animated face.</i></b>

16:21.647 --> 16:23.657
<b><i>I truly am blessed.</i></b>

16:25.317 --> 16:28.077
<b><i>She is so talented, and yet here she is</i>
<i>as my retainer,</i></b>

16:28.157 --> 16:31.707
<b><i>where if the world were at peace,</i>
<i>she would surely be idolized by all.</i></b>

16:41.797 --> 16:45.547
<b>I ask you again. Are you a Hojo?</b>

16:46.297 --> 16:51.137
<b><i>It's not good. His mind is fully dominated</i>
<i>by that Dengaku dance from before.</i></b>

16:51.227 --> 16:55.017
<b><i>The way his heart is palpitating</i>
<i>must be because of that as well.</i></b>

16:55.097 --> 16:56.857
<b><i>Now I'll never get an honest answer.</i></b>

16:57.437 --> 16:59.017
<b>Enough. You may go.</b>

17:00.397 --> 17:03.277
<b>Just remember that if you try to interfere
on the battlefield again,</b>

17:03.357 --> 17:05.817
<b>I will kill you without hesitation.</b>

17:07.027 --> 17:10.327
<b>Understood. Then I'll be taking
my leave, Lord Sadamune.</b>

17:15.747 --> 17:18.957
<b>Are you sure about this? Why not just
kill him now if you're suspicious?</b>

17:19.037 --> 17:22.207
<b>This is just how he is.
Ever since the dog-shooting competition.</b>

17:22.297 --> 17:26.387
<b>He openly acknowledges what is good
and expresses praise with his whole being.</b>

17:26.467 --> 17:29.927
<b>He readily accepted my advice
to correct his posture, and not once</b>

17:30.007 --> 17:33.387
<b>did he let that posture slump,
no matter how I tried to corner him.</b>

17:33.477 --> 17:38.397
<b>Such candor is peculiar these days, when
everyone is suspicious of one another.</b>

17:38.977 --> 17:43.687
<b>It would be rude to doubt a person
when they are being so sincere.</b>

17:46.487 --> 17:49.827
<b>Ayako, where did you learn
to put on such a performance?</b>

17:51.157 --> 17:52.537
<b>Do I have you intrigued?</b>

17:53.117 --> 17:55.997
<b>It made me forget
all about Sadamune hounding me.</b>

17:56.787 --> 17:59.417
<b>Because I couldn't stop thinking
about you.</b>

18:01.127 --> 18:04.297
<b>Whoa! Honesty is scary!
It's almost like a weapon.</b>

18:10.927 --> 18:12.757
<b>Hey, Young Lord…</b>

18:18.557 --> 18:22.977
<b>How dare you… How dare you…
How dare you, how dare you, how dare you…</b>

18:23.067 --> 18:29.197
<b>How dare you! How dare you
make my lord think less of me!</b>

18:29.277 --> 18:32.697
<b>You miserable brats are nothing
but lip service and parlor tricks!</b>

18:32.777 --> 18:34.907
<b>Never mind sending you back to Suwa.</b>

18:34.997 --> 18:37.077
<b>I'll send you to the ground
with my martial arts!</b>

18:37.747 --> 18:40.167
<b>-Young Lord! Stay back!
-Too slow!</b>

18:42.667 --> 18:44.377
<b>Dance! Dance! Dance!</b>

18:47.837 --> 18:49.087
<b>How do you like the taste of that?</b>

18:49.177 --> 18:53.717
<b>I've been using this naginata for longer
than you've been alive!</b>

18:54.467 --> 18:57.387
<b><i>This guy has unwavering faith</i>
<i>in his skills with a naginata.</i></b>

19:00.147 --> 19:01.517
<b>Get back here!</b>

19:01.607 --> 19:03.147
<b><i>Kojiro is the same with his sword.</i></b>

19:03.227 --> 19:06.237
<b><i>I don't have any weapons</i>
<i>I'm especially good at wielding.</i></b>

19:07.897 --> 19:09.567
<b><i>But instead…</i></b>

19:11.487 --> 19:12.777
<b>What the…</b>

19:27.507 --> 19:31.927
<b>Hey! What are you doing?
Stop that! Let go of me!</b>

19:32.587 --> 19:37.017
<b>Wait! You bitch!
Don't think you'll get away with this.</b>

19:37.097 --> 19:38.807
<b><i>Whether it be a kick, or a rock,</i></b>

19:38.887 --> 19:41.267
<b><i>or my opponent's weapon,</i>
<i>or a musical instrument…</i></b>

19:42.397 --> 19:46.107
<b>Wait… All right! Let's talk this out!</b>

19:49.397 --> 19:51.777
<b><i>I will make the most</i>
<i>of this body I have been given</i></b>

19:51.857 --> 19:53.777
<b><i>and use whatever I can get my hands on!</i></b>

19:53.867 --> 19:58.037
<b>What do you want?
Do you want money? A sword?</b>

19:59.157 --> 20:01.667
<b>Shit! This bitch is insanely strong!</b>

20:05.627 --> 20:07.337
<b>Wait…</b>

20:07.417 --> 20:08.917
<b><i>I don't need to choose a weapon.</i></b>

20:13.507 --> 20:16.047
<b><i>I just need to protect my lord!</i></b>

20:19.807 --> 20:22.387
<b><i>Shinano had Tomoe Gozen,</i>
<i>a faithful retainer.</i></b>

20:22.977 --> 20:25.937
<b><i>Echigo had Hangaku Gozen,</i>
<i>a military commander who led a rebellion.</i></b>

20:26.567 --> 20:29.567
<b><i>And Totomi had Jiro Ii,</i>
<i>a female feudal lord.</i></b>

20:30.317 --> 20:32.527
<b><i>History has long documented the roles</i></b>

20:32.607 --> 20:34.817
<b><i>of women fighting bravely</i>
<i>throughout the country.</i></b>

20:36.277 --> 20:39.747
<b>All right. Now for the finishing snap.</b>

20:40.247 --> 20:41.457
<b>Wait!</b>

20:42.457 --> 20:43.827
<b>We're not fighting today.</b>

20:43.917 --> 20:46.707
<b>He only came as a messenger.
Killing him will only aggravate matters.</b>

20:46.787 --> 20:48.247
<b>You can snap his neck another day.</b>

20:48.337 --> 20:51.217
<b>-Huh? Really?
-Yes! Of course!</b>

20:51.297 --> 20:54.047
<b>All right. You're very kind, Young Lord.</b>

21:00.597 --> 21:02.887
<b>You know, Young Lord,
when you came to Shinano,</b>

21:02.977 --> 21:05.147
<b>I thought it must be fate.</b>

21:06.057 --> 21:08.937
<b>A fledgling ruler came to give me a chance</b>

21:09.017 --> 21:11.777
<b>to become the Tomoe Gozen
that I've always admired.</b>

21:12.897 --> 21:14.657
<b>And it's thanks to you, Young Lord.</b>

21:14.737 --> 21:16.777
<b>You're the reason I was able
to throw myself into the arts,</b>

21:16.867 --> 21:18.447
<b>both martial and performance.</b>

21:18.527 --> 21:22.447
<b>I will use everything I have learned
to protect you, Young Lord.</b>

21:22.537 --> 21:28.247
<b>And when I'm done protecting you,
I will bear you lots and lots of children!</b>

21:29.667 --> 21:31.337
<b>So, Young Lord,</b>

21:33.167 --> 21:35.627
<b>take me whenever you like.</b>

21:38.717 --> 21:40.927
<b><i>Does she even realize what she's saying?</i></b>

21:42.057 --> 21:44.847
<b>-I'm so embarrassed!
-Hey!</b>

21:44.937 --> 21:46.727
<b><i>Everything she says and does</i>
<i>is to the extreme.</i></b>

21:46.807 --> 21:48.307
<b><i>She is larger-than-life.</i></b>

21:48.397 --> 21:52.777
<b><i>She truly is defined by absolute,</i>
<i>pure loyalty and a radiant heart.</i></b>

21:52.857 --> 21:56.107
<b><i>I'm sure she'll be a strong and beautiful</i>
<i>military commander one day.</i></b>

21:57.357 --> 22:00.657
<b><i>And I hope I can be a lord worthy of her.</i></b>

22:02.997 --> 22:04.957
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>

23:39.007 --> 23:40.007
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
